<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Inco reinstated as outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Inco reinstated as outperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it reinstated coverage of Inco Ltd as outperform.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended at 32-1/8 Monday in U.S. trading.</p>
